<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>The Aryan Educational Society v. Aaryan International School, CS(COMM) 46/2024</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Jyoti Singh J</td></tr>
